This package implements CBOR tag 44252 as defined in the specification
"CBOR Tag 44252: Metrological Values" by Achim Friedland, GraphDefined GmbH,
a copy of which is included in the source repository under spec/.

The unit registry data in src/registry/units.json is transcribed from
Section 4 of that specification.

No third-party code is bundled with this package. It has no runtime
dependencies.
